  "releaseNotes": "### Changes since 6.0.0 Alpha 1\n* Moved Dictionary extensions to ``AlastairLundy.Extensions.Collections.Generics`` namespace and move file location to sub folder of Generics\n* Moved non Generic ICollection extension methods to non generics namespace\n* Removed redundant ``Replace`` enumerable extension method overload\n* Removed redundant ``ToString`` enumerable extension method overload - The generic method is still available\n* Clarified C# language version used to be C# 13\n* Renamed ``TryElementAt(this ICollection collection, int index, out object? value)`` ICollection non generic method to ``TryGetElementAt(this ICollection collection, int index, out object? value)``\n* Renamed ``TryIndexesOf`` collection generic method to ``TryGetIndexesOf``\n* * Renamed ``TryIndexesOf`` collection non-generic method to ``TryGetIndexesOf``\n* Changed return type of ``IndexesOf`` in generic Collection extension and non-generic Collection extensions from ``ICollection<int>`` to ``IEnumerable<int>``",
